<p><em>With our {{ get_age('2007-12-10') }} years of experience,</em> we offer <em>several courses</em> ranging from HTML5 / CSS3 to the development of complex applications with Symfony.</p>

<img class="arrow" src="{{ asset('build/images/balise_left.svg') }}" alt="{% trans %}left arrow{% endtrans %}"/>
<h3 class="trainings">our different courses</h3>
<img class="arrow" src="{{ asset('build/images/balise_right.svg') }}" alt="{% trans %}right arrow{% endtrans %}"/>

<div class="courses">
    {% for course in courses %}
        <a href="{{ path('website_courses') }}#{{ course.name }}" title="{{ course.title }}" class="courses-icon">
            {{ file_get_public_contents('build/images/' ~ course.icon ~'.svg') |raw }}
        </a>
    {% endfor %}
</div>
